{"task_id": "DR001", "vertical": "deep_research", "subtype": "recommendation_decision", "title_zh": "博士项目与申请路线选择", "title_en": "PhD program and application-path decision", "canonical_language": "zh", "task_prompt_zh": "我想要提升我的学历，我计划在未来 1-2 年内申请国外的人工智能博士项目，但目前尚未确定具体研究方向。我希望了解不同国家和地区（如北美、欧洲、亚洲）的高校在该领域的研究实力、课程设置、学术资源以及就业前景。同时，我关心申请所需的条件（语言要求、背景提升、科研或实习经验）、学费和奖学金政策，以及如何根据自身条件制定一份有竞争力的申请规划。请帮我梳理各主要国家/地区的院校和项目特点，列出典型代表院校，并提供选择方向和提升背景的策略建议。", "task_prompt_en": "I want to advance my academic qualifications. I plan to apply for PhD programs in artificial intelligence abroad within the next 1–2 years, but I have not yet decided on a specific research direction. I would like to understand the research strengths, curriculum structure, academic resources, and employment prospects of universities in different countries and regions (for example, North America, Europe, and Asia). At the same time, I care about the application requirements (language requirements, ways to strengthen my background, research or internship experience), tuition and scholarship policies, and how to create a competitive application plan based on my own circumstances. Please help me outline the characteristics of institutions and programs in the major countries/regions, list typical representative universities, and provide recommendations on choosing a direction and improving my background.", "construction_stage": "normalized_seed", "selection_status": "provisional_selected_requires_human_and_environment_validation", "paper_first": {"included": true, "priority_rank": 1, "status": "priority_for_environment_binding_not_runnable", "selection_basis": "vertical_and_reasoning_coverage_signal_balance_and_source_continuity"}, "source": {"source_id": "pdr_bench", "source_locator": "task_1", "source_class": "existing_benchmark_derived", "license": "Apache-2.0", "use_policy": "direct_task_reuse_with_attribution", "url": "https://github.com/OPPO-PersonalAI/PersonalizedDeepResearchBench", "snapshot": "5b43f9f188c747d154fc7666812ab93b7ca6a3c2"}, "long_horizon_eligibility": {"multi_step_autonomy": true, "multiple_reasonable_paths": true, "complex_artifact": true, "task_relevant_user_difference_can_change_artifact": true, "invariant_objective_quality_is_checkable": true, "not_one_prompt_trivial": true, "authoring_gate_status": "pass_pending_empirical_pilot"}, "reasoning_structures": ["multi_criteria_comparison", "resource_discovery", "action_planning"], "personalization_design": {"primary_signal_mode": "history_grounded_latent_preference", "eligible_counterfactual_axes": ["research_direction", "geography", "funding_need", "career_goal"], "explicit_constraint_only": false, "persona_and_contract_status": "not_yet_authored", "required_next_gate": "two_humans_confirm_that_at_least_one_decision_node_should_change"}, "invariant_core": {"same_task_shell": true, "same_evidence_or_repo_or_dataset": true, "same_tools_and_budget": true, "objective_checks": ["factuality", "citation_validity", "shared_task_requirements"]}, "user_conditioned_verifier_plan": ["recommendation_or_plan", "priority", "actionability"], "required_tools": ["web_search", "page_fetch"], "risk_level": "medium", "expert_review_required": false, "environment_binding_status": "pending", "evidence_snapshot_status": "pending", "screening": {"relevance": 2, "counterfactual_separability": 2, "invariant_core": 2, "objective_verifier": 2, "long_horizon": 2, "total": 10, "status": "provisional_author_pass"}, "upstream_candidate_user_ids": ["User1", "User3", "User5", "User11", "User18"]}
{"task_id": "DR008", "vertical": "deep_research", "subtype": "literature_synthesis", "title_zh": "复杂多引文 RAG 的高质量训练数据方案", "title_en": "Training data for complex multi-citation RAG", "canonical_language": "zh", "task_prompt_zh": "研究团队正在改进一个需要多跳检索和精确归因的领域问答系统。简单单引文问题表现良好，但复杂问题的覆盖率和引用准确率明显下降。\n\n请完成以下长程工作：\n1. 系统梳理复杂问答、合成数据、归因学习与数据质量控制方法；\n2. 区分教师错误、问题难度分布偏移和训练目标错配；\n3. 比较至少三条数据构造路线并提出消融和人工审计方案；\n4. 给出可执行的数据课程、质量门和失败停止条件；\n\n最终交付：一份含证据矩阵、候选方案比较、实验设计和数据生产流程的研究决策报告。", "task_prompt_en": "A research team is improving a domain QA system that requires multi-hop retrieval and precise attribution. Simple single-citation questions work, while complex questions fail on coverage and citation accuracy.\n\nComplete the following long-horizon work:\n1. Review methods for complex QA, synthetic data, attribution learning, and quality control;\n2. Separate teacher error, difficulty-distribution shift, and objective mismatch;\n3. Compare at least three construction routes with ablations and human audit;\n4. Deliver an executable curriculum, quality gates, and stop conditions;\n\nFinal deliverable: A research decision report with an evidence matrix, alternatives, experiments, and data-production workflow.", "construction_stage": "normalized_seed", "selection_status": "provisional_selected_requires_human_and_environment_validation", "paper_first": {"included": true, "priority_rank": 2, "status": "priority_for_environment_binding_not_runnable", "selection_basis": "vertical_and_reasoning_coverage_signal_balance_and_source_continuity"}, "source": {"source_id": "researcherbench", "source_locator": "question_1_structure_only", "source_class": "existing_benchmark_derived", "license": "no_repository_license_detected_on_2026-08-16", "use_policy": "structure_only_no_verbatim_prompt_copy", "url": "https://github.com/GAIR-NLP/ResearcherBench", "snapshot": "accessed_2026-08-16"}, "long_horizon_eligibility": {"multi_step_autonomy": true, "multiple_reasonable_paths": true, "complex_artifact": true, "task_relevant_user_difference_can_change_artifact": true, "invariant_objective_quality_is_checkable": true, "not_one_prompt_trivial": true, "authoring_gate_status": "pass_pending_empirical_pilot"}, "reasoning_structures": ["literature_landscape", "causal_diagnosis", "method_comparison", "experiment_design"], "personalization_design": {"primary_signal_mode": "explicit_constraints", "eligible_counterfactual_axes": ["risk_tolerance", "available_annotation_budget", "target_domain", "team_expertise"], "explicit_constraint_only": false, "persona_and_contract_status": "not_yet_authored", "required_next_gate": "two_humans_confirm_that_at_least_one_decision_node_should_change"}, "invariant_core": {"same_task_shell": true, "same_evidence_or_repo_or_dataset": true, "same_tools_and_budget": true, "objective_checks": ["claims_cited", "alternatives_compared", "teacher_error_measured"]}, "user_conditioned_verifier_plan": ["recommended_pipeline", "human_review_allocation", "evaluation_thresholds"], "required_tools": ["web_search", "paper_fetch", "citation_manager"], "risk_level": "medium", "expert_review_required": false, "environment_binding_status": "pending", "evidence_snapshot_status": "pending", "screening": {"relevance": 2, "counterfactual_separability": 2, "invariant_core": 2, "objective_verifier": 2, "long_horizon": 2, "total": 10, "status": "provisional_author_pass"}}
{"task_id": "DR014", "vertical": "deep_research", "subtype": "dataset_resource_discovery", "title_zh": "遥感灾害识别数据集的约束式发现与谱系核验", "title_en": "Constraint-based discovery of remote-sensing hazard datasets", "canonical_language": "zh", "task_prompt_zh": "研究者需要找到可用于跨地区灾害识别的公开遥感数据集，并确认标注对象、空间分辨率、时间覆盖、许可证和数据谱系。\n\n请完成以下长程工作：\n1. 根据性质组合进行宽搜而不是按单一名称查找；\n2. 核对原始论文、数据卡、版本和镜像之间的谱系；\n3. 排除标签泄漏、地域重叠和许可不兼容；\n4. 形成满足不同研究目标的候选集合；\n\n最终交付：可机读数据集清单、证据链接、排除日志和推荐组合。", "task_prompt_en": "A researcher needs public remote-sensing datasets for cross-region hazard detection and must verify labels, spatial resolution, temporal coverage, licenses, and lineage.\n\nComplete the following long-horizon work:\n1. Search by property combinations rather than names;\n2. Verify lineage across papers, data cards, versions, and mirrors;\n3. Exclude label leakage, geographic overlap, and license conflicts;\n4. Build candidate sets for different research goals;\n\nFinal deliverable: A machine-readable dataset inventory, evidence links, exclusion log, and recommended bundle.", "construction_stage": "normalized_seed", "selection_status": "provisional_selected_requires_human_and_environment_validation", "paper_first": {"included": true, "priority_rank": 3, "status": "priority_for_environment_binding_not_runnable", "selection_basis": "vertical_and_reasoning_coverage_signal_balance_and_source_continuity"}, "source": {"source_id": "livedrbench", "source_locator": "NovelDatasets_and_extraction_structure", "source_class": "existing_benchmark_derived", "license": "dataset_CDLA-Permissive-2.0; code_MIT", "use_policy": "problem_inversion_and_claim_discovery_structure", "url": "https://github.com/microsoft/livedrbench", "snapshot": "accessed_2026-08-16"}, "long_horizon_eligibility": {"multi_step_autonomy": true, "multiple_reasonable_paths": true, "complex_artifact": true, "task_relevant_user_difference_can_change_artifact": true, "invariant_objective_quality_is_checkable": true, "not_one_prompt_trivial": true, "authoring_gate_status": "pass_pending_empirical_pilot"}, "reasoning_structures": ["claim_discovery", "dataset_lineage", "constraint_satisfaction", "exhaustive_search"], "personalization_design": {"primary_signal_mode": "goal_tradeoff", "eligible_counterfactual_axes": ["target_region", "label_granularity", "compute_budget", "license_policy"], "explicit_constraint_only": false, "persona_and_contract_status": "not_yet_authored", "required_next_gate": "two_humans_confirm_that_at_least_one_decision_node_should_change"}, "invariant_core": {"same_task_shell": true, "same_evidence_or_repo_or_dataset": true, "same_tools_and_budget": true, "objective_checks": ["dataset_identity", "license_verified", "split_leakage_audited"]}, "user_conditioned_verifier_plan": ["dataset_bundle", "sampling_strategy", "exclusion_threshold"], "required_tools": ["web_search", "dataset_catalog", "paper_fetch"], "risk_level": "medium", "expert_review_required": false, "environment_binding_status": "pending", "evidence_snapshot_status": "pending", "screening": {"relevance": 2, "counterfactual_separability": 2, "invariant_core": 2, "objective_verifier": 2, "long_horizon": 2, "total": 10, "status": "provisional_author_pass"}}
{"task_id": "DR020", "vertical": "deep_research", "subtype": "conflicting_evidence", "title_zh": "亲子沟通干预的证据与情境冲突", "title_en": "Conflicting evidence for parent-child communication interventions", "canonical_language": "zh", "task_prompt_zh": "我发现最近孩子与我们的沟通变少了，我计划在未来半年内通过一系列的亲子活动增强与孩子的情感联结，并提高沟通技巧。请为我提供一个综合的亲子沟通与情感发展计划，包括情绪表达与管理训练、亲子共读书单、冲突解决技巧、以及如何通过家庭游戏、角色扮演和沟通练习提升孩子的社交与情感理解能力。还请结合心理学和教育学的研究，提出具体的实践方法，并评估不同活动形式在增强亲子关系和促进孩子情感成长方面的效果。", "task_prompt_en": "I have noticed that my child’s communication with us has decreased recently. I plan to enhance our emotional connection and improve communication skills through a series of parent-child activities in the next six months. Please provide a comprehensive parent-child communication and emotional development plan, including emotional expression and management training, a shared reading list, conflict resolution techniques, and how to improve my child’s social and emotional understanding through family games, role-playing, and communication exercises. Please also incorporate research from psychology and education, suggest specific practical methods, and assess the effectiveness of different activity formats in strengthening parent-child relationships and promoting my child’s emotional growth.", "construction_stage": "normalized_seed", "selection_status": "provisional_selected_requires_human_and_environment_validation", "paper_first": {"included": true, "priority_rank": 4, "status": "priority_for_environment_binding_not_runnable", "selection_basis": "vertical_and_reasoning_coverage_signal_balance_and_source_continuity"}, "source": {"source_id": "pdr_bench", "source_locator": "task_49", "source_class": "existing_benchmark_derived", "license": "Apache-2.0", "use_policy": "direct_task_reuse_with_attribution", "url": "https://github.com/OPPO-PersonalAI/PersonalizedDeepResearchBench", "snapshot": "5b43f9f188c747d154fc7666812ab93b7ca6a3c2"}, "long_horizon_eligibility": {"multi_step_autonomy": true, "multiple_reasonable_paths": true, "complex_artifact": true, "task_relevant_user_difference_can_change_artifact": true, "invariant_objective_quality_is_checkable": true, "not_one_prompt_trivial": true, "authoring_gate_status": "pass_pending_empirical_pilot"}, "reasoning_structures": ["behavioral_evidence_synthesis", "contextualization", "program_design"], "personalization_design": {"primary_signal_mode": "knowledge_and_audience", "eligible_counterfactual_axes": ["child_age", "conflict_pattern", "family_schedule", "privacy_boundary"], "explicit_constraint_only": false, "persona_and_contract_status": "not_yet_authored", "required_next_gate": "two_humans_confirm_that_at_least_one_decision_node_should_change"}, "invariant_core": {"same_task_shell": true, "same_evidence_or_repo_or_dataset": true, "same_tools_and_budget": true, "objective_checks": ["factuality", "citation_validity", "shared_task_requirements"]}, "user_conditioned_verifier_plan": ["recommendation_or_plan", "priority", "actionability"], "required_tools": ["web_search", "page_fetch"], "risk_level": "high", "expert_review_required": true, "environment_binding_status": "pending", "evidence_snapshot_status": "pending", "screening": {"relevance": 2, "counterfactual_separability": 2, "invariant_core": 2, "objective_verifier": 2, "long_horizon": 2, "total": 10, "status": "provisional_author_pass"}, "upstream_candidate_user_ids": ["User10", "User12", "User13", "User16", "User17"]}
{"task_id": "DR022", "vertical": "deep_research", "subtype": "temporal_update", "title_zh": "AI 监管更新后的产品决策重算", "title_en": "Recompute product decisions after an AI-regulation update", "canonical_language": "zh", "task_prompt_zh": "产品研究已完成大半时，某一目标市场发布新的实施规则或延迟生效通知；系统必须在保留未受影响证据的同时重算合规与发布建议。\n\n请完成以下长程工作：\n1. 冻结更新前的证据与初步决策；\n2. 核验新文件的权威性、适用范围和生效时间；\n3. 定位受影响与不受影响的决策节点；\n4. 输出变更日志并与一次性获得新状态的 oracle 对照；\n\n最终交付：更新后的决策报告、差分说明、旧状态残留审计和证据版本表。", "task_prompt_en": "Midway through product research, a target market issues a new implementing rule or delayed-effective-date notice; the system must recompute the launch advice without discarding unaffected evidence.\n\nComplete the following long-horizon work:\n1. Freeze pre-update evidence and preliminary decisions;\n2. Verify authority, scope, and effective date;\n3. Locate affected and unaffected decision nodes;\n4. Produce a change log and compare with a one-shot-new oracle;\n\nFinal deliverable: An updated decision report, diff explanation, stale-state audit, and evidence version table.", "construction_stage": "normalized_seed", "selection_status": "provisional_selected_requires_human_and_environment_validation", "paper_first": {"included": true, "priority_rank": 5, "status": "priority_for_environment_binding_not_runnable", "selection_basis": "vertical_and_reasoning_coverage_signal_balance_and_source_continuity"}, "source": {"source_id": "plhkw_authored", "source_locator": "new_gap_temporal_update_1", "source_class": "newly_authored", "license": "project_owned", "use_policy": "new_task_shell", "url": "local", "snapshot": "v0.54"}, "long_horizon_eligibility": {"multi_step_autonomy": true, "multiple_reasonable_paths": true, "complex_artifact": true, "task_relevant_user_difference_can_change_artifact": true, "invariant_objective_quality_is_checkable": true, "not_one_prompt_trivial": true, "authoring_gate_status": "pass_pending_empirical_pilot"}, "reasoning_structures": ["temporal_update", "dependency_propagation", "conflict_resolution", "stale_state_suppression"], "personalization_design": {"primary_signal_mode": "interactive_information_acquisition", "eligible_counterfactual_axes": ["launch_market", "release_date", "risk_posture", "ability_to_delay"], "explicit_constraint_only": false, "persona_and_contract_status": "not_yet_authored", "required_next_gate": "two_humans_confirm_that_at_least_one_decision_node_should_change"}, "invariant_core": {"same_task_shell": true, "same_evidence_or_repo_or_dataset": true, "same_tools_and_budget": true, "objective_checks": ["unaffected_claims_preserved", "source_authority_checked", "old_rule_not_misapplied"]}, "user_conditioned_verifier_plan": ["launch_decision", "mitigation_scope", "escalation_trigger"], "required_tools": ["web_search", "official_document_fetch", "checkpoint_injection"], "risk_level": "high", "expert_review_required": true, "environment_binding_status": "pending", "evidence_snapshot_status": "pending", "screening": {"relevance": 2, "counterfactual_separability": 2, "invariant_core": 2, "objective_verifier": 2, "long_horizon": 2, "total": 10, "status": "provisional_author_pass"}}
{"task_id": "SW001", "vertical": "software_engineering", "subtype": "feature_implementation", "title_zh": "为 Web 服务加入可配置缓存层", "title_en": "Add a configurable caching layer", "canonical_language": "zh", "task_prompt_zh": "在给定 Web 框架仓库中实现可配置的读缓存，处理失效、并发、错误回退和兼容性。\n\n请完成以下长程工作：\n1. 调查现有扩展点与调用路径；\n2. 比较至少两种实现并记录决策；\n3. 实现功能、迁移说明和回退；\n4. 补充单元、集成和回归测试；\n\n最终交付：可运行 patch、测试、设计说明和性能测量。", "task_prompt_en": "Implement configurable read caching in a web-framework repository, including invalidation, concurrency, error fallback, and compatibility.\n\nComplete the following long-horizon work:\n1. Inspect extension points and call paths;\n2. Compare at least two implementations and record the decision;\n3. Implement functionality, migration, and rollback;\n4. Add unit, integration, and regression tests;\n\nFinal deliverable: A runnable patch, tests, design note, and performance measurements.", "construction_stage": "normalized_seed", "selection_status": "provisional_selected_requires_human_and_environment_validation", "paper_first": {"included": true, "priority_rank": 6, "status": "priority_for_environment_binding_not_runnable", "selection_basis": "vertical_and_reasoning_coverage_signal_balance_and_source_continuity"}, "source": {"source_id": "swe_bench_verified", "source_locator": "django_style_repo_binding_pending", "source_class": "existing_benchmark_derived", "license": "MIT_harness; repository_specific_code_licenses", "use_policy": "real_repo_shell_and_invariant_test_pattern; personalized_overlay_is_new", "url": "https://www.swebench.com/SWE-bench/guides/quickstart/", "snapshot": "repo_instance_binding_pending"}, "long_horizon_eligibility": {"multi_step_autonomy": true, "multiple_reasonable_paths": true, "complex_artifact": true, "task_relevant_user_difference_can_change_artifact": true, "invariant_objective_quality_is_checkable": true, "not_one_prompt_trivial": true, "authoring_gate_status": "pass_pending_empirical_pilot"}, "reasoning_structures": ["repo_investigation", "arc