{"task_id": "SW007", "vertical": "software_engineering", "subtype": "debugging_remediation", "title_zh": "诊断符号化简的内存爆炸", "title_en": "Diagnose symbolic-simplification memory blow-up", "canonical_language": "zh", "task_prompt_zh": "符号计算库在特定表达式上出现内存爆炸，需要定位算法路径并选择修复或保护策略。\n\n请完成以下长程工作：\n1. 构造最小复现与规模曲线；\n2. 定位递归、缓存或组合爆炸点；\n3. 比较精确修复、启发式剪枝和资源上限；\n4. 验证正确性与性能回归；\n\n最终交付：诊断报告、patch 或防护、基准和回归测试。", "task_prompt_en": "A symbolic-computation library suffers memory blow-up on a class of expressions; locate the algorithmic path and choose repair or guardrails.\n\nComplete the following long-horizon work:\n1. Build a minimal reproducer and scaling curve;\n2. Locate recursion, caching, or combinatorial explosion;\n3. Compare exact repair, heuristic pruning, and resource guards;\n4. Verify correctness and performance;\n\nFinal deliverable: A diagnosis, patch or guard, benchmark, and regression tests.", "construction_stage": "normalized_seed", "selection_status": "provisional_selected_requires_human_and_environment_validation", "paper_first": {"included": true, "priority_rank": 7, "status": "priority_for_environment_binding_not_runnable", "selection_basis": "vertical_and_reasoning_coverage_signal_balance_and_source_continuity"}, "source": {"source_id": "swe_bench_verified", "source_locator": "sympy_style_repo_binding_pending", "source_class": "existing_benchmark_derived", "license": "MIT_harness; repository_specific_code_licenses", "use_policy": "real_repo_shell_and_invariant_test_pattern; personalized_overlay_is_new", "url": "https://www.swebench.com/SWE-bench/guides/quickstart/", "snapshot": "repo_instance_binding_pending"}, "long_horizon_eligibility": {"multi_step_autonomy": true, "multiple_reasonable_paths": true, "complex_artifact": true, "task_relevant_user_difference_can_change_artifact": true, "invariant_objective_quality_is_checkable": true, "not_one_prompt_trivial": true, "authoring_gate_status": "pass_pending_empirical_pilot"}, "reasoning_structures": ["algorithmic_debuggi