{"task_id": "SW013", "vertical": "software_engineering", "subtype": "architecture_dependency", "title_zh": "为知识产品选择向量检索架构", "title_en": "Choose a vector-search architecture", "canonical_language": "zh", "task_prompt_zh": "一个已有全文搜索产品要增加语义检索，需要在本地库、PostgreSQL 扩展和托管向量服务之间选择并完成最小实现。\n\n请完成以下长程工作：\n1. 调查仓库、数据流和部署约束；\n2. 建立成本、延迟、隐私、恢复和锁定比较；\n3. 写 ADR 并实现最小端到端切片；\n4. 用统一相关性与故障测试验证；\n\n最终交付：ADR、可运行实现、基准、测试与迁移路径。", "task_prompt_en": "A full-text-search product needs semantic retrieval and must choose among a local library, a PostgreSQL extension, and a hosted vector service, then implement a minimum path.\n\nComplete the following long-horizon work:\n1. Inspect repository, data flow, and deployment constraints;\n2. Compare cost, latency, privacy, recovery, and lock-in;\n3. Write an ADR and implement a minimum slice;\n4. Validate with common relevance and failure tests;\n\nFinal deliverable: An ADR, runnable implementation, benchmarks, tests, and migration path.", "construction_stage": "normalized_seed", "selection_status": "provisional_selected_requires_human_and_environment_validation", "paper_first": {"included": true, "priority_rank": 8, "status": "priority_for_environment_binding_not_runnable", "selection_basis": "vertical_and_reasoning_coverage_signal_balance_and_source_continuity"}, "source": {"source_id": "plhkw_authored", "source_locator": "new_gap_architecture_1", "source_class": "newly_authored", "license": "project_owned", "use_policy": "new_task_shell", "url": "local", "snapshot": "v0.54"}, "long_horizon_eligibility": {"multi_step_autonomy": true, "multiple_reasonable_paths": true, "complex_artifact": true, "task_relevant_user_difference_can_change_artifact": true, "invariant_objective_quality_is_checkable": true, "not_one_prompt_trivial": true, "authoring_gate_status": "pass_pending_empirical_pilot"}, "reasoning_structures": ["architecture_research", "dependency_choice", "implementation", "evaluation"], "personalization_design": {"primary_signal_mode": "interact