{"task_id": "DA003", "vertical": "data_analysis", "subtype": "exploratory_business_analysis", "title_zh": "零售品类增长与毛利冲突诊断", "title_en": "Retail growth-versus-margin diagnosis", "canonical_language": "zh", "task_prompt_zh": "给定门店、订单、促销、库存和退货数据，识别收入增长与毛利恶化的共同原因。\n\n请完成以下长程工作：\n1. 统一 SKU、门店和促销口径；\n2. 分解价格、数量、组合、折扣和退货效应；\n3. 检查季节性和数据截断；\n4. 生成角色条件化的行动组合；\n\n最终交付：分析 workbook/notebook、桥接图、异常表和决策建议。", "task_prompt_en": "Given store, order, promotion, inventory, and return data, identify drivers of revenue growth and margin deterioration.\n\nComplete the following long-horizon work:\n1. Align SKU, store, and promotion definitions;\n2. Decompose price, volume, mix, discount, and return effects;\n3. Check seasonality and truncation;\n4. Generate role-conditioned action portfolios;\n\nFinal deliverable: An analysis workbook/notebook, bridge chart, anomaly table, and recommendations.", "construction_stage": "normalized_seed", "selection_status": "provisional_selected_requires_human_and_environment_validation", "paper_first": {"included": true, "priority_rank": 9, "status": "priority_for_environment_binding_not_runnable", "selection_basis": "vertical_and_reasoning_coverage_signal_balance_and_source_continuity"}, "source": {"source_id": "dsbench", "source_locator": "analysis_task_shell_binding_pending", "source_class": "existing_benchmark_derived", "license": "noncommercial_dataset_terms_and_upstream_rights", "use_policy": "structure_only; do_not_redistribute_upstream_data", "url": "https://github.com/LiqiangJing/DSBench", "snapshot": "task_binding_pending"}, "long_horizon_eligibility": {"multi_step_autonomy": true, "multiple_reasonable_paths": true, "complex_artifact": true, "task_relevant_user_difference_can_change_artifact": true, "invariant_objective_quality_is_checkable": true, "not_one_prompt_trivial": true, "authoring_gate_status": "pass_pending_empirical_pilot"}, "reasoning_structures": ["data_reconciliation", "variance_decomposition", "confound_audit", "decision_support"]