{"task_id": "DA007", "vertical": "data_analysis", "subtype": "spreadsheet_workflow", "title_zh": "构建三表联动的财务预测模型", "title_en": "Build an integrated three-statement forecast", "canonical_language": "zh", "task_prompt_zh": "给定历史财报、假设表和部分模板，完成利润表、资产负债表与现金流量表联动预测。\n\n请完成以下长程工作：\n1. 检查工作簿结构与历史公式；\n2. 建立驱动假设和跨表依赖；\n3. 完成预测、平衡检查和情景切换；\n4. 生成面向决策者的关键图表；\n\n最终交付：完成的 xlsx、检查表、假设说明和摘要页。", "task_prompt_en": "Given historical statements, an assumptions sheet, and a partial template, complete an integrated income statement, balance sheet, and cash-flow forecast.\n\nComplete the following long-horizon work:\n1. Inspect workbook structure and historical formulas;\n2. Build drivers and cross-sheet dependencies;\n3. Complete forecast, balance checks, and scenarios;\n4. Create decision-oriented charts;\n\nFinal deliverable: A completed xlsx, checks sheet, assumptions note, and summary page.", "construction_stage": "normalized_seed", "selection_status": "provisional_selected_requires_human_and_environment_validation", "paper_first": {"included": true, "priority_rank": 10, "status": "priority_for_environment_binding_not_runnable", "selection_basis": "vertical_and_reasoning_coverage_signal_balance_and_source_continuity"}, "source": {"source_id": "spreadsheetbench2", "source_locator": "financial_model_binding_pending", "source_class": "existing_benchmark_derived", "license": "repository_and_dataset_license_audit_pending", "use_policy": "workflow_structure_only_until_license_and_workbook_audit", "url": "https://github.com/RUCKBReasoning/SpreadsheetBench-2", "snapshot": "task_binding_pending"}, "long_horizon_eligibility": {"multi_step_autonomy": true, "multiple_reasonable_paths": true, "complex_artifact": true, "task_relevant_user_difference_can_change_artifact": true, "invariant_objective_quality_is_checkable": true, "not_one_prompt_trivial": true, "authoring_gate_status": "pass_pending_empirical_pilot"}, "reasoning_structures": ["spreadsheet_inspection", "financial_modeling", "dependency_r