{"task_id": "DA011", "vertical": "data_analysis", "subtype": "predictive_modeling", "title_zh": "资源约束下的客户流失预测", "title_en": "Customer-churn modeling under deployment constraints", "canonical_language": "zh", "task_prompt_zh": "给定客户行为与流失标签，开发可提交的预测管线，并在性能、解释性和部署资源之间作选择。\n\n请完成以下长程工作：\n1. 审计泄漏、时间切分和不平衡；\n2. 建立可复现基线与验证；\n3. 比较特征、模型和校准；\n4. 生成提交、模型卡和部署评估；\n\n最终交付：训练代码、预测文件、实验表、模型卡和建议。", "task_prompt_en": "Given customer behavior and churn labels, develop a submission-ready prediction pipeline while trading off performance, explainability, and deployment resources.\n\nComplete the following long-horizon work:\n1. Audit leakage, temporal split, and imbalance;\n2. Build reproducible baseline and validation;\n3. Compare features, models, and calibration;\n4. Produce submission, model card, and deployment assessment;\n\nFinal deliverable: Training code, predictions, experiment table, model card, and recommendation.", "construction_stage": "normalized_seed", "selection_status": "provisional_selected_requires_human_and_environment_validation", "paper_first": {"included": true, "priority_rank": 11, "status": "priority_for_environment_binding_not_runnable", "selection_basis": "vertical_and_reasoning_coverage_signal_balance_and_source_continuity"}, "source": {"source_id": "mle_bench", "source_locator": "tabular_competition_binding_pending", "source_class": "existing_benchmark_derived", "license": "MIT_code; Kaggle_competition_terms_apply_to_data", "use_policy": "environment_and_grading_pattern; competition_data_not_redistributed", "url": "https://github.com/openai/mle-bench", "snapshot": "competition_binding_pending"}, "long_horizon_eligibility": {"multi_step_autonomy": true, "multiple_reasonable_paths": true, "complex_artifact": true, "task_relevant_user_difference_can_change_artifact": true, "invariant_objective_quality_is_checkable": true, "not_one_prompt_trivial": true, "authoring_gate_status": "pass_pending_empirical_pilot"}, "reasoning_structures": ["data_audit", "modeling"