{"task_id": "DA015", "vertical": "data_analysis", "subtype": "experiment_design", "title_zh": "产品功能分阶段上线实验设计", "title_en": "Staged rollout experiment for a product feature", "canonical_language": "zh", "task_prompt_zh": "给定历史行为数据和有限流量，设计新功能的分阶段上线实验，兼顾学习速度、风险和长期指标。\n\n请完成以下长程工作：\n1. 定义估计对象、主指标、护栏和异质效应；\n2. 评估随机化单元、干扰和样本量；\n3. 比较固定样本、序贯和分阶段方案；\n4. 生成分析代码、停止规则和监测计划；\n\n最终交付：预分析计划、功效模拟、代码、仪表板规格和决策规则。", "task_prompt_en": "Given historical behavior and limited traffic, design a staged rollout experiment balancing learning speed, risk, and long-term outcomes.\n\nComplete the following long-horizon work:\n1. Define estimand, primary metric, guardrails, and heterogeneity;\n2. Assess randomization unit, interference, and power;\n3. Compare fixed, sequential, and staged designs;\n4. Produce analysis code, stopping rules, and monitoring;\n\nFinal deliverable: A pre-analysis plan, power simulation, code, dashboard spec, and decision rules.", "construction_stage": "normalized_seed", "selection_status": "provisional_selected_requires_human_and_environment_validation", "paper_first": {"included": true, "priority_rank": 12, "status": "priority_for_environment_binding_not_runnable", "selection_basis": "vertical_and_reasoning_coverage_signal_balance_and_source_continuity"}, "source": {"source_id": "plhkw_authored", "source_locator": "new_gap_experiment_1", "source_class": "newly_authored", "license": "project_owned", "use_policy": "new_task_shell", "url": "local", "snapshot": "v0.54"}, "long_horizon_eligibility": {"multi_step_autonomy": true, "multiple_reasonable_paths": true, "complex_artifact": true, "task_relevant_user_difference_can_change_artifact": true, "invariant_objective_quality_is_checkable": true, "not_one_prompt_trivial": true, "authoring_gate_status": "pass_pending_empirical_pilot"}, "reasoning_structures": ["causal_design", "power_analysis", "sequential_decision", "risk_management"], "personalization_design": {"primary_signal_mode": "interactive_information_acquisition"